    "body": "- We believe the right to be forgotten wins here over the right to save the data (that should not have been saved)\r\n- We are deleting all messages and blanking out post content and post.title where they match the tweet\r\n- We need to notify the users of the twittter datasource so they know this is coming\r\n- We can do this with a migration since it will apply to everyone who has used the Twitter datasource at any point\r\n     - Messages.message will be blanked out for tweets\r\n     - Posts.content will be blanked out _when_ it matches the tweet exactly. \r\n     - Posts.title will be replaced with `From twittter on {date}`  _when_ it matches the tweet exactly. \r\n",
